This project is not yet finished...

Done so far:
- FastAPI server with mounted static pages
- Routes for `/`, `/register`, `/login` and custom 404 page
- SQLite database with `users` table created on startup
- User registration API at `/api/register`
- User login API at `/api/login`
- Password hashing with `bcrypt`
- JWT token generation after successful login
- Request validation with Pydantic
- Timestamp validation for register/login requests
- Duplicate user detection during registration
- Repository system where each repository contains one or more projects
- Repository creation API at `/api/repositories`
- Public explore view with repository cards and user profiles
- Public repository pages and public user profile pages
- Dashboard with repository creation, nested project names and public profile editing
- File-based repository index stored in `user_projects/repositories_index.json`
- Automated tests for routes, database, register API, login API, repository API and utilities
- Logging with `INFO` by default and `DEBUG` when `DEBUG=true` in `server/.env`

Repository model:
- Repository example: `superloginsite`
- Projects inside repository: `server`, `client`
- Private repositories stay on the owner dashboard
- Public repositories are visible in `/explore` and on user profile pages
